{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "basic-osm-vfr",
  "metadata": {
    "design:intent": "Low-clutter VFR moving-map base. Muted terrain-ish land tints plus DEM hillshade so magenta/blue airspace, tracks and traffic overlays drawn on top stay dominant. Emphasises the features pilots actually navigate by: relief, water, motorways, railways, populated areas, aerodromes and peak elevations (in feet).",
    "design:constraints": "Sprite sheet is empty and only 'Noto Sans Regular' is available, so no icon-image and no bold/italic text anywhere. Airfield and peak markers are drawn with circle layers instead of sprites.",
    "design:overlays": "Reserve magenta (#c026a0-ish) and blue (#0050c8) for the app's airspace/NOTAM/traffic layers. Motorways and primary roads use muted brick red (#93392b/#d4614a), so overlays should prefer magenta/blue or fully saturated red rather than earthy reds.",
    "design:landuse": "Forest and farmland landcover are intentionally not drawn - under hillshade they muddied the relief and buried the roads. Grass, wetland, rock/sand, ice and parks stay as weak tints; landuse (populated, industrial, military) stays because those are visual ground references.",
    "design:relief": "The 'relief' raster-dem source is Web-Mercator terrain-RGB (512 px, mapbox encoding, z0-12; z13+ upstream is interpolated z12, so MapLibre overzooms instead). Drives the 'hillshade' layer; add a root-level 'terrain' property against the same source if 3D is ever wanted."
  },
  "center": [14.95271, 46.15018],
  "zoom": 8,
  "bearing": 0,
  "pitch": 0,
  "sources": {
    "openmaptiles": {
      "type": "vector",
      "tiles": ["https://tiles.kanardia.eu/mvt/tiles/{z}/{x}/{y}.pbf"],
      "minzoom": 0,
      "maxzoom": 14,
      "attribution": "<a href=\"https://www.openmaptiles.org/\" target=\"_blank\">&copy; OpenMapTiles</a> <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\" target=\"_blank\">&copy; OpenStreetMap contributors</a>"
    },
    "relief": {
      "type": "raster-dem",
      "tiles": ["https://tiles.kanardia.eu/terrain/{z}/{x}/{y}.webp"],
      "encoding": "mapbox",
      "tileSize": 512,
      "maxzoom": 12,
      "attribution": "<a href=\"https://www.maptiler.com/copyright/\" target=\"_blank\">&copy; MapTiler</a>"
    }
  },
  "glyphs": "https://tiles.kanardia.eu/mvt/fonts/{fontstack}/{range}.pbf",
  "sprite": "https://tiles.kanardia.eu/mvt/sprites/sprite",
  "layers": [
    {
      "id": "background",
      "type": "background",
      "paint": { "background-color": "#f8f6f0" }
    },

    {
      "id": "landcover-ice",
      "type": "fill",
      "source": "openmaptiles",
      "source-layer": "landcover",
      "minzoom": 6,
      "filter": ["==", ["get", "class"], "ice"],
      "paint": { "fill-color": "#f2f8fc" }
    },

    {
      "id": "hillshade",
      "type": "hillshade",
      "source": "relief",
      "paint": {
        "hillshade-exaggeration": [
          "interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 4, 0.55, 10, 0.38, 13, 0.28
        ],
        "hillshade-illumination-direction": 335,
        "hillshade-illumination-anchor": "viewport",
        "hillshade-shadow-color": "rgba(92, 82, 66, 0.38)",
        "hillshade-highlight-color": "rgba(255, 253, 244, 0.3)",
        "hillshade-accent-color": "rgba(126, 110, 88, 0.22)"
      }
    },

    {
      "id": "park-fill",
      "type": "fill",
      "source": "openmaptiles",
      "source-layer": "park",
      "minzoom": 7,
      "paint": { "fill-color": "#dceccb", "fill-opacity": 0.35 }
